    "description": "Case Study Essay 15.0%",
    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">CCM301 · Assessment 1/5</span>\n<h2>Case Study Essay</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13398 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">CCM301 · Đầu điểm 1/5</span>\n<h2>Case Study Essay</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13398 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">15.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">Follow lecturer's</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO2, CLO4, CLO5, CLO7</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">Evaluative</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">Test the acquainted knowledge which student obtained in the delivered chapters (Chapter 1, 6, 7, 8)</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">Individual Assessment (At home)<br>Type: Essay<br>Weight: 15%<br>Length: 1,500-2,000 words<br>Task Description:<br>Choose from the list of crisis case studies provided by the lecturer before and analyse one organisational crisis.<br>Your essay will include an overview of the crisis, a description of the organisation, a crisis timeline, actions and responses taken, a media analysis, stakeholder impacts, lessons learned, recommendations, and use appropriate matrix/models.<br>The essay should address the criteria as outlined in the assessment task and rubric mentioned during the class.<br>Students should use a mix of scholarly references, media coverage and organisational materials, as well as applying AI-tools to collect information and analyze the chosen crisis.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
