    "description": "Crisis Group Project 25.0%",
    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">CCM301 · Assessment 3/5</span>\n<h2>Crisis Group Project</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13398 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">CCM301 · Đầu điểm 3/5</span>\n<h2>Crisis Group Project</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13398 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">25.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">Follow lecturer's</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1, CLO2, CLO3, CLO4, CLO5, CLO6, CLO7</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">The whole class is divided into groups. Each group is assigned to make one crisis communication plan</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">Test the acquainted knowledge and skills which student obtained in the delivered chapters (Chapter 1-8, with an emphasis on Chapter 2-5)</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">Group Assessment<br>Type: Crisis Communication Plan (At Home) + Presentation (In the class)<br>Weight: 25%<br>Task Description:<br>Students working within a small group setting of 4-6 students to select one organisation in Vietnam, which must be accepted by the lecturer, then propose a crisis communication plan for that organisation. The plan must showcase all knowledge the students have gained in the class, and be delivered as a final report to their chosen organisation.<br>AI Application: Students have to demonstrate their capability of applying AI tool (ChatGPT, Claude.ai, etc...) in preparing templates in the crisis communication plan, which include (but aren't limited to) prewritten news release(s) and media alert.<br><br>Presentation: For the 15-minute presentation, each group have to showcase all of your key points mentioned in your report in front of your classmates.<br><br>Notes:<br>The detailed structure of a crisis communication plan could be found in the textbook (Chapter 5)<br>Further details of the crisis communication plan will be provided in class. The detailed marking criteria for this assessment will be provided to you by your lecturer.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">The mark will be given based on each student's performance, not on the whole group's. It means each student will get their own mark.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 46 — Crisis Group Project - Presentation</li><li>Session 47 — Crisis Group Project - Presentation</li><li>Session 48 — Crisis Group Project - Presentation</li><li>Session 49 — Crisis Group Project - Presentation</li><li>Session 50 — Crisis Group Project - Presentation</li><li>Session 51 — Crisis Group Project - Presentation</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 46 — Crisis Group Project - Presentation</li><li>Buổi 47 — Crisis Group Project - Presentation</li><li>Buổi 48 — Crisis Group Project - Presentation</li><li>Buổi 49 — Crisis Group Project - Presentation</li><li>Buổi 50 — Crisis Group Project - Presentation</li><li>Buổi 51 — Crisis Group Project - Presentation</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
